   "title": "Troubleshooting the Oscillator Control Assembly (A12)",
   "source": "§5-17, 5700A/5720A Series II Service Manual, pages 5-69 to 5-72. Printed as one section of ten steps; the numbering here is the manual's own. Steps 1–7 check the averaging converter, steps 8–10 the ac/dc transfer circuit.",
